WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:20.159
Ah, my young friends, the three months had almost passed.

2
00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:24.534
Aladdin's mother was shopping for a dress at the bazaar.

3
00:00:24.535 --> 00:00:29.154
Her son's wedding to the princess would be very soon.

4
00:00:29.155 --> 00:00:32.217
Zeba wanted to look her best.

5
00:00:32.218 --> 00:00:37.549
But something very strange was happening.

6
00:00:37.550 --> 00:00:41.758
People were singing and dancing in the street.

7
00:00:41.759 --> 00:00:45.534
"What's going on?" Zeba wondered.

8
00:00:45.535 --> 00:00:50.270
She hurried to a vegetable stand as a merchant packed up his onions.

9
00:00:50.271 --> 00:00:54.084
"Why are you closing?" she asked.

10
00:00:54.085 --> 00:00:58.227
"The whole kingdom is celebrating!" he said.

11
00:00:58.228 --> 00:01:04.201
"Tomorrow, Princess Badra will marry Kasim, the son of the grand vizier!"

12
00:01:04.202 --> 00:01:10.209
"Oh, my poor Aladdin!" cried Zeba, and she hurried home.

13
00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:14.163
Bursting through the front door of their house, she called out,

14
00:01:14.164 --> 00:01:17.421
"The sultan has broken his promise!"

15
00:01:17.422 --> 00:01:21.067
"What are you talking about, Mother?" asked Aladdin.

16
00:01:21.068 --> 00:01:25.609
"Princess Badra is to be married tomorrow," cried Zeba.

17
00:01:25.610 --> 00:01:28.858
"To the vizier's son!"

18
00:01:28.859 --> 00:01:32.370
"But she was promised to me," said Aladdin.

19
00:01:32.371 --> 00:01:34.816
"I must stop the wedding."

20
00:01:34.817 --> 00:01:37.780
"How?" asked Zeba.

21
00:01:37.781 --> 00:01:40.561
"Don't worry," said Aladdin.

22
00:01:40.562 --> 00:01:44.915
"Princess Badra will not marry anyone but me!"

23
00:01:44.916 --> 00:01:50.482
Aladdin went to his room and locked the door.

24
00:01:50.483 --> 00:01:54.531
He took the lamp from its hiding place under some cushions.

25
00:01:54.532 --> 00:02:00.316
He rubbed the lamp until smoke swirled around the room.

26
00:02:00.317 --> 00:02:06.274
"The genie of the wonderful lamp is back!" said the cheerful genie.

27
00:02:06.275 --> 00:02:09.474
"Your wish is my command!"

28
00:02:09.475 --> 00:02:14.306
"Oh, genie of the lamp, go to the palace!" ordered Aladdin.

29
00:02:14.307 --> 00:02:19.004
"When Princess Badra is alone, bring her to me."

30
00:02:19.005 --> 00:02:21.299
"I hear and obey!"

31
00:02:21.300 --> 00:02:24.926
said the genie and disappeared in a blink.

32
00:02:24.927 --> 00:02:30.354
An hour later, the genie returned with Princess Badra in his arms.

33
00:02:30.355 --> 00:02:35.382
"Put me down!" yelled the princess.

34
00:02:35.383 --> 00:02:42.366
"I hear and obey," laughed the genie and dropped her on the floor.

35
00:02:42.367 --> 00:02:46.940
"Ow!" cried the princess, rubbing her backside.

36
00:02:46.941 --> 00:02:51.710
She stood up, shaking with anger. "Who are you?"

37
00:02:51.711 --> 00:02:54.578
"I am the genie of the wonderful—"

38
00:02:54.579 --> 00:02:59.035
"Silence!" she cried, stamping her foot.

39
00:02:59.036 --> 00:03:01.520
Then she noticed Aladdin.

40
00:03:01.521 --> 00:03:05.813
"Who are you?" she asked in a softer voice.

41
00:03:05.814 --> 00:03:07.951
"I am Aladdin," he said.

42
00:03:07.952 --> 00:03:10.420
"I am going to be your husband."

43
00:03:10.421 --> 00:03:13.778
"You?" laughed the princess.

44
00:03:13.779 --> 00:03:19.644
"That's strange. I thought I was marrying Kasim tomorrow."

45
00:03:19.645 --> 00:03:25.678
You see, my young friends, Princess Badra did not want to marry Kasim.

46
00:03:25.679 --> 00:03:28.863
They had been children together in the palace.

47
00:03:28.864 --> 00:03:33.401
Kasim had always been lazy and mean to everyone.

48
00:03:33.402 --> 00:03:39.752
But Princess Badra saw that Aladdin was handsome and seemed kind.

49
00:03:39.753 --> 00:03:43.885
"Your father promised you to me," said Aladdin.

50
00:03:43.886 --> 00:03:49.884
"Well, my father listens too much to that awful vizier," she replied.

51
00:03:49.885 --> 00:03:54.568
"That is why I must marry his silly son."

52
00:03:54.569 --> 00:03:58.306
"Do not marry him, Princess," said Aladdin.

53
00:03:58.307 --> 00:04:01.610
"No one could ever love you as I do."

54
00:04:01.611 --> 00:04:08.214
Suddenly the princess felt the air become hot, and the room began to spin.

55
00:04:08.215 --> 00:04:13.607
After hearing his words of love, her heart started beating faster.

56
00:04:13.608 --> 00:04:19.419
All at once, she knew she was in love too—with Aladdin!

57
00:04:19.420 --> 00:04:21.870
"The genie will take you home.

58
00:04:21.871 --> 00:04:27.258
In the morning, tell your father that you will not marry Kasim," said Aladdin.

59
00:04:27.259 --> 00:04:30.303
"And don't tell anyone about me."

60
00:04:30.304 --> 00:04:35.244
The next morning, the palace was buzzing with wedding preparations.

61
00:04:35.245 --> 00:04:39.306
The princess's attendants tiptoed into her room early.

62
00:04:39.307 --> 00:04:43.429
But they quickly came out again with shocking news.

63
00:04:43.430 --> 00:04:48.001
"The wedding is off!" they shouted.

64
00:04:48.002 --> 00:04:51.036
Servants ran up and down the halls.

65
00:04:51.037 --> 00:04:53.597
"The wedding is off!"

66
00:04:53.598 --> 00:04:57.035
The palace guards carried messages back and forth.

67
00:04:57.036 --> 00:05:00.485
"The wedding is off!"

68
00:05:00.486 --> 00:05:05.948
The grand vizier entered the sultan's chamber and came back out screaming,

69
00:05:05.949 --> 00:05:12.143
"THE WEDDING IS OFF!"
